# Fedora package name translation.
#
# Left column  = canonical name used in packages/*.txt (Arch spelling)
# Right column = Fedora name(s), or `-` when the package does not exist there.
# Globs are tried after exact matches, in file order.
#
# This is best effort: anything not listed is attempted with its Arch name and
# a missing package only produces a warning (unless --strict is used).

